{"id": "HIST-001-R6", "version": 1, "type": "decision", "origin": "reconstructed", "status": "proposed", "tier": "candidate", "subject": "aec-scope", "text": "Run hooks through the installed AEC package or AEC_HOME/src, reporting unavailable installation.", "source_sha256": "1c78c7f2a33ce0a7561612a2c398802032a4a08f165fa8723218b0786a82ac7d", "reconstruction": {"id": "HIST-001-R6", "text": "Run hooks through the installed AEC package or AEC_HOME/src, reporting unavailable installation.", "source_path": "specs/001-ast-bedrock-extension/research.md", "source_section": "R6. How the commands reach the `aec` package from a hook", "source_quote": "it never fails silently."}, "relations": [{"rel": "depends_on", "to": "HISTSRC-HIST-001-R6@1"}]}
